## 🛠️ Technology Stack

| Layer | Technology |
|---|---|
| **Architecture** | Core PHP 8.0+ (Modular include architecture, clean separation of concerns) |
| **Styling** | Tailwind CSS v3 (Modern SaaS design system, dark/light theme, custom scrollbars) |
| **PDF Processing** | PDF-Lib (client-side generation/editing), PDF.js (in-browser rendering) |
| **Image Processing** | HTML5 Canvas 2D API, WebAssembly image codecs, JSZip |
| **Routing & SEO** | Apache `.htaccess` (mod_rewrite 301 engine), PHP development `router.php` |
| **Server Compatibility** | LiteSpeed, Apache 2.4+, Nginx (with rewrite directives), cPanel |

