## 💻 Local Development Setup

### Option 1: Using PHP Built-In Server (Recommended)
Clone the repository and launch the built-in development router from the project root:

```bash
# Clone the repository
git clone https://github.com/sudhanshuthinktocode/imgfixy-tools.git
cd imgfixy-tools

# Start local server with routing rules
php -S 127.0.0.1:8000 router.php
